{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "DMD Media Showcase Server API",
    "summary": "Live Multilingual Retro Games, Movies, TV Series & Anime Showcase Server for LED Matrices",
    "description": "Self-hosted, stateless multilingual media & video trailer streaming server for **ArcadeMatrix (ESP32 / ESP32-S3)** and **ArcadeMatrix_RPi** LED matrices.\n\n### Key Features\n- **100% Live Random Discovery by Category**: Queries ScreenScraper, ArcadeItalia ADB, IGDB, TMDB, IMDb, TVMaze, Jikan v4, Kitsu, AnimeThemes.moe, Wikipedia, and Dailymotion with zero hardcoded mock catalogs.\n- **Granular Top-to-Bottom Panoramas**: Independently toggle `jacket_panorama` (default `true`), `marquee_panorama` (default `false`), and `snapshot_panorama_count` (`0..5`, default `0`).\n- **Multi-Format & TATE Geometries**: Supports `256x64`, `128x64`, `128x32`, `64x64`, and vertical TATE (`64x128`, `64x256`, `32x128`) resolutions.\n- **Language-Agnostic Trailers**: Automatically extracts video trailers and openings in any language since the DMD is mute.",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "System"
        ],
        "summary": "Get Health",
        "description": "Return server health, worker pool saturation, and configured live scraper providers.",
        "operationId": "get_health_api_v1_health_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/{domain}/filters": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Discovery"
        ],
        "summary": "Get Domain Filters",
        "description": "Return exhaustive live filter categories, systems, genres, decades, and sources for `domain`.",
        "operationId": "get_domain_filters_api_v1__domain__filters_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "domain",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "enum": [
                "games",
                "movies",
                "series",
                "anime"
              ],
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Domain"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "lang",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Preferred UI language (`fr`, `en`, `es`, `de`, `it`)",
              "default": "fr",
              "title": "Lang"
            },
